Every reg_* is an offset from armrec_io_base here, so the addresses of
eight of them are not constant expressions and this table cannot be
initialised statically. The header declares it `const` and is included
by other files, so the declaration has to stay; what changes is where
the object lives: an explicit .data section, because an uninitialised
const array would otherwise land in .rodata and the fill would fault.
3ds/src/3ds_sdk_statics.c fills it once, after the slab exists.

